Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:05.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'm in my apartment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:05.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我自己在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:08.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}doing the Soap Opera Digest crossword puzzle...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:08.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}填《肥皂剧文摘》的字谜游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:11.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and guess who is the clue for three down?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:11.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你猜谁是纵三的字谜提示
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:15.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three down, "Days of Our Lives star, blank Tribbiani."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:15.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}纵三  《我们的日子》空格·崔比安尼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's me! I'm blank!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我  我是空格
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:21.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How cool is this! We know three down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:21.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太酷了  我们认识纵三
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm touching three down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在碰纵三
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:25.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you are, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:25.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:26.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three down knows I'm married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:26.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}纵三知道我结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's three down doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}纵三在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.69,0:00:32.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So do they call to tell you your name's gonna be in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.69,0:00:32.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们有通知你上了杂志吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. They really like me over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有  他们杂志很喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:36.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They wanted to do a big profile on me, but I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:36.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想找我做人物专访  我拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:37.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why'd you say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:37.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember what happened the last time I did an interview for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得我上次接受采访的结果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:43.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I said I write a lot of my own lines, the writers got mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:43.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说我自己写了不少台词  编剧抓狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:46.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and made my character fall down the elevator shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:46.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我的角色摔下了电梯间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:49.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who knows what I might say this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:49.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁知道这次我会说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:50.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If only there was something in your head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:50.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是你脑子里有种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.89,0:00:52.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to control the things you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.89,0:00:52.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能控制你说的每句话就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:57.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Joey, you'll totally keep it in check this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了  这次你会表现得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:58.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And plus, you know the publicity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:58.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且这种宣传造势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}would be really good for your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对你的事业也很有帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You deserve that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你应得的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:05.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And if you do the interview, you could mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:05.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在专访里  你可以提到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:07.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, "gal pal Rachel Green."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:07.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"女性朋友瑞秋·格林"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:10.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that "gal pal" spelled LOSER?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"女性朋友"的意思是失败者吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:15.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, don't listen to him. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:15.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  别听他的  拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:17.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine, all right, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:17.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我接受采访
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:19.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you guys have to be at the next table
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:19.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你们都得坐在旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:22.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so you can stop me if I start to say something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:22.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要是开始说蠢话  就及时阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.55,0:01:24.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just then, or all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.55,0:01:24.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只指专访时还是一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:27.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because we have jobs, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:27.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们还得去上班
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:32.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll be there for you the whole time. Just remember:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:32.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会一直在场的  但你得记住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gal pal, Rachel Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女性朋友瑞秋·格林
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:37.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna be in Soap Opera Digest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:37.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要上《肥皂剧文摘》了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:40.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And not just in the dumb crossword puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:40.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不只是上那个愚蠢的字谜游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的以你为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:46.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E19 The One With Joey’s Interview
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:46.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第19集  乔伊接受采访
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:27.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really appreciate you taking the time to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:27.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你抽空接受访问
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.97,0:02:29.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not at all. Happy to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.97,0:02:29.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别客气  我很乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think we're being obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们觉得我们做得很明显吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:36.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. We're just four people with neck problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:36.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我们只是四个脖子有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:37.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}who talk like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说话不正常的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:41.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's great you wanted to meet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:41.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}约在这里见面实在不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:44.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When most people hear the magazine's paying for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:44.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大多数人听说餐费会由杂志社来买单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}they want a big, fancy restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都会约到高级大餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:50.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I didn't know the magazine was paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:50.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的不知道杂志社会买单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wouldn't have mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:56.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do this for the fans, not the free food.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这么做是为了影迷  不是为了白吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:59.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Can I get you anything?  I'll have a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:59.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们要点些什么  咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'll have all the muffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各种松饼统统来一份
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能说话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}终于可以不说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So according to your bio,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据你的个人资料
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.55,0:03:17.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you've done quite a bit of work before Days of Our Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.55,0:03:17.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在《我们的日子》之前你做过很多工作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:19.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything that you're particularly proud of?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:19.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪份工作尤其令你自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:25.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All you want is a dingle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:25.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想要的只不过是个小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What you envy's a shwang
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你所嫉妒的是男人的老二
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A thing through which you can tinkle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它可以用来撒尿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:36.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or play with, or simply let hang
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:36.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}时而拿来玩弄  时而让其悬空摇摆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Folks, has this ever happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位  你们遇到过这种情况吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:53.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You go to the refrigerator to get a nice glass of milk,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:53.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打开冰箱  想喝杯牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:57.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and these darn cartons are so flingin'flangin' hard to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:57.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但纸盒很难打开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, you said it, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你说得对  麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:04.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} There's gotta be a better way!  And there is, Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:04.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定有更棒的办法  没错  凯文
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the first time he's ever used this product,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是他第一次使用这样产品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you're gonna see how easy this is to do. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们会看到使用方法有多简单  来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:13.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} This works in any milk can'ton.  It is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:13.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这适用于所有牛奶纸盒  确实简单
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now I can have milk every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我每天都能喝牛奶了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So this is it, Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这样了吗  维克多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I guess it is. And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:25.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜是吧  所以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm gonna get on this spaceship...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要搭上这艘太空船
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I'm gonna go to Blargon 7 in search of alternative fuels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到巴拉根七号星寻找替代能源
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:46.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But when I return 200 years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:46.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但两百年后我再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:48.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you'll be long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:48.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你早已经不在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I won't have aged at all.
