Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:24.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Oh, dear God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:24.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not much to tell there. I'm really shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么好说的  我真的很害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:37.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So that's it. I guess that's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:37.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了  我猜我已经问完了
