Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想应该下一期就会刊出你的访问
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:45.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, great. Great. Thank you.
