Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to ask everybody this:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们对每个人都要提这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:20:59.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Other than Days, what's your favorite soap opera?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:20:59.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了《我们的日子》以外你最喜欢哪出肥皂剧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.51,0:21:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I don't watch soap operas. Excuse me?
