Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的生活没那么无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. The readers at Soap Opera Digest
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  《肥皂剧文摘》的读者
