Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:12.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:12.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常好
